  "review": [
    "Nested defaulted deny-unknown coalescing settings validate count2..64/time1..16; None/None preserves immediate default. High-DPI/foreground mode visibly unavailable, no fabricated packet provenance.",
    "PendingMotion holds original user/device/PID/HWND/client geometry and settings, latest transformed absolute position or checked i64 delta sum; oldest deadline/count safety bounded. Desktop pending slots are per mouse within each target, and a device changing target/geometry drains original slot before accepting new identity.",
    "Fixed delta publication validates widened effective motion and splits to bounded native packets; chunk logic inspected, not independently unit/native exercised. Automatic/concurrent logical clipping remains per packet; fixed relative intermediate native clipping/hover equivalence is not claimed.",
    "Flushing takes each pending segment before publication and wraps errors over the whole actual closure; all slots/targets are attempted and typed errors collected. Failed work is not replayed to a later target.",
    "Router settings/position/mode/pause/lifecycle/discrete boundaries drain earlier publications. Automatic poll failures become per-user status, and failed barriers withhold only affected new non-release input; every key/button UP and unrelated input still attempts routing. Fixed assigned loss remains fatal.",
    "Engine layers forward poll/deadline; worker idle timeout wakes at oldest queue deadline (10ms maximum wait). Per-packet transform/logical cursor, annotation and graph consumers remain before backend publication buffering.",
    "Typed stale resize publication is discarded, reported and current clamped goal retried once. Shutdown attempts publication/release cleanup and existing queue fences; no vendor/native ABI change.",
    "GUI uses actual existing Ouroboros controls/keyboard adapter, stable selected-user context and same additive settings payload. Contract accurately leaves native/scheduling/physical/general-app and fixed-boundary limits open."
  ],
  "unit_evidence_scope": [
    "Production PendingMotion tests cover latest absolute, widened sum, oldest clock/count safety, geometry identity and checked overflow/no mutation.",
    "Production motion_failure_blocks_input regression covers all5button-UP/key-UP and unrelated input.",
    "Exact native target/window/pending lifecycle interleavings and relative chunk ABI remain source-only unless later bounded native traces establish them."
  ],
